<!--
  Material Symbols 'bookmark_stacks' (outlined, wght 400) — the library, as a stack of
  saved things.

  A local vector rather than `material-icons-extended`: that artifact ships several thousand
  paths for the handful this app uses and put tens of megabytes into the debug APK
  (`steering/tech-stack.md` §3).

  Material Symbols are drawn on a 960 grid with a -960..0 y-axis, so the group shifts that
  into Android's 0..960 viewport. The path is Google's own, unmodified.
-->
